DESCRIPTION:Experience an evening of compelling artistry as guest pianist 
 Andrew Willis takes the stage for a solo recital.\n\nKnown for his expres
 sive musicianship\, thoughtful interpretation\, and engaging presence\, W
 illis brings each work to life with clarity\, depth\, and imagination. Th
 is recital offers audiences an opportunity to experience the remarkable r
 ange and expressive power of the piano in the hands of an accomplished ar
 tist.\n\nThis event is free and open to the public. All are welcome.
