DESCRIPTION:There’s something special about cooking over an open fire! Jo
 in a Park Ranger to learn the basics of campfire cooking\, from preparing 
 a cooking fire to making delicious treats over the flames. We’ll explore
  different cooking techniques\, share tips for safe campfire cooking\, and
  enjoy some tasty samples along the way. Come hungry\, bring a lawn chair\
 , and get ready for some fireside fun. All ages welcome! Children must be 
 accompanied by an adult.
