DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Volunteer Trail Workday at William B. Umstead Sta
 te Park! We will be focused on constructing a new portion of trail which w
 ill connect some of our historic campgrounds to the lake. \n\nNo experienc
 e is required and all materials will be provided. Please wear close-toed s
 hoes and proper attire. Bring plenty of water and snacks.\n\nRegister here
