SUMMARY:How to Create a Character Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Performance Art with the Fun of Playing Dress Up \nA workshop introduction to designing a character for performance art. All supplies\, including accessories and costumes\, will be provided. An interactive presentation will lead to each individual designing their own character and performing a very short (1 minute) idea of who that character is. There are no wrong answers\, it’s all about play and getting more comfortable in your own skin.
