DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Friday 4-6 p
 m at Brier Creek on corner with Starbucks: 7854 Alexander Prom Pl\, Raleig
 h\, NC 27617\; park at Walmart). \n\nThis will be a POSITIVE and nonviolen
 t demonstration. We are here to protect our democracy. We are standing up 
 for what we believe in. We want to inspire people to join us and grow our 
 movement!\n\nPlease bring positive signs only. Some examples: Instead of &
 quot\;Stop defunding science&quot\; Say &quot\;Protect Research&quot\; &qu
 ot\;Immigrants make us stronger&quot\; &quot\;Housing for all&quot\; &quot
 \;Healthcare for all&quot\; &quot\;Save the planet&quot\;\n\nMake signs ab
 out what you&#39\;re standing up for -- whether that is the libraries\, DE
 I\, healthcare\, women’s rights\n\nPlease no mocking signs\, no swastika
 s\n\nWe are excited to see you there and stand together for our country!\n
 \nSee you every Friday engaging drivers at Brier Creek in Raleigh.\n\nPlea
 se join our Substack: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://substa
 ck.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sour
 ce=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3y7Kv9RwiMPWcPPUFQih9k" target="_bla
 nk">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</
 a>\n\nFor more ED4D Mobilize Events: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q
 =https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sourc
 e=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1xqNbFip0P6DfK4plFB1D7" target="_blan
 k">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/</a>\n\n<a href="ht
 tps://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemoc
 racy/event/841392/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvV
 aw3b-d5FofmPq5VM3C7ztbph" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/engagede
 fendersfordemocracy/event/841392/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T223314Z
