X-SOURCE-URLS:{"American Tobacco Campus": "https://americantobacco.co/events/cirque-du-soleil-twas-the-night-before-5/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Americantobaccocampus": "https://americantobacco.co/events/cirque-du-soleil-twas-the-night-before-2026-11-25-2026-11-26-2026-11-27-2026-11-28-2026-11-29/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:americantobaccocampus
X-SOURCE:American Tobacco Campus
UID:1287@americantobacco.co
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261129T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261129T150000
DTSTAMP:20260803T151130Z
URL:https://americantobacco.co/events/cirque-du-soleil-twas-the-night-befo
 re-2026-11-25-2026-11-26-2026-11-27-2026-11-28-2026-11-29/
SUMMARY:Cirque du Soleil | 'Twas The Night Before
DESCRIPTION:‘TWAS THE NIGHT BEFORE… is Cirque du Soleil’s first holi
 day show\, based on the classic poem “A Visit from Saint Nicholas” by 
 Clement Clarke Moore. Memorable lines from this cherished classic inspired
  Cirque’s story about a jaded young girl who rediscovers the magic of th
 e holidays.\n\nA festive flurry of love and cheer created especially for f
 amilies\, ‘TWAS THE NIGHT BEFORE… features thrilling acrobatics\, lo
 vable characters - and a soundtrack including holiday classics re-invented
  by Cirque du Soleil. The show was conceived and is directed by Cirque du 
 Soleil Senior Artistic Director James Hadley\, a 25-year veteran of circus
  productions and live theater.\n\nThis show will be in town for 17 perform
 ances across nine days. Note that showtimes vary. Get your tickets here!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/07/Twas-the-Night-Before.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Holiday,Performances
LOCATION:Durham Performing Arts Center (DPAC)\, 123 Vivian Street / William
  V. 'Bill' Bell Way\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
