 pating businesses: East of Texas\, Fullsteam\, Seraphine\, Lutra Cafe &amp
 \; Bakery\, Ment Beverage Co.\, Parker &amp\; Otis\, Yoga Off East.\n\nMor
 e information on drink specials and artists/vendors coming soon.
