X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar Group African American Cultural Center": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/study-jam-lock-in-the-aacc"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_group_african_american_cultural_center
X-SOURCE:NC State African American Cultural Center
DTSTAMP:20261121T064038Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54551676537635
DTSTART:20261204T220000Z
DTEND:20261205T030000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come lock in on your finals and goals at the African American C
 ultural Center on Dec. 2-4.\n\nThe center's library and its third floor wi
 ll remain open each day until 10 p.m. Dinner will be available Dec. 2 and 
 4 at 6 p.m. Registration is required to receive dinner. \n\nBring your stu
 dy groups\, friends or come solo to our warm and supportive environment. A
 s you prepare for finals and work toward your goals\, we'll celebrate your
  efforts with goodies and a prize drawing. \n\nIf you need a brain break\,
  get creative at our wellness station\, which will be full of crafting sup
 plies and activities. \n\nThe library has technology you can check out\, p
 lus laptops\, external monitors (great for group study)\, calculators\, ch
 argers and over-the-ear headphones that you can check out to use in the li
 brary. Be sure to bring your student ID.
GEO:35.785108;-78.674529
LOCATION:Witherspoon Student Center\, African American Cultural Center 
SUMMARY:Study Jam/Lock-In at the African American Cultural Center
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/study-jam-lock-in-the-aacc
CATEGORIES:Student Life
CATEGORIES:De-Stress Fest
END:VEVENT
