UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54551060179836
DTSTART:20261208T150000Z
DTEND:20261208T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:How long have the trees been in the park? Were they here during
  dinosaurs\, the invention of the automobile\, or the internet?!? How does
  one determine the age of a tree without coring to count the rings? Join u
 s to uncover the story of selected trees by estimating their age using yar
 n and some basic math skills (use that calculator app on your phone to hel
 p with the division & multiplication skills). After ages are determined\, 
 we can discuss what was happening during that period in the world and what
  the trees have lived through. Open for elementary age to adults. Meet at 
 the Visitor Center back porch.
GEO:34.670531;-77.143056
LOCATION:Hammocks Beach State Park
SUMMARY:Histotree
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/histotree
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
END:VEVENT
