SUMMARY:Holiday Meetup Program and Social! Last event of 2026
DESCRIPTION:All Things Open RTP Meetup\nJoin us for our final event of 202
 6! We'll end the year together\, just the way we started it back in Januar
 y at Spacewalk.\n\nDecember will combine both a traditional program with w
 orld-class presentations AND an amazing networking opportunity. Featured t
 alks will be announced soon - be on the lookout.\n\n**Location:**\nWe want
  to do something special\, so the venue will be The Carolina Theater in do
 wntown Durham\, NC. We'll start in Cinema One with programming\, then move
  outside to the concession area for the networking social.\n\n**Carolina T
 heater**\n[Address](https://www.google.com/search?sa=X&sca_esv=9e40641db8b
 a5a4c&rlz=1C5AJCO_enUS1192US1199&biw=2202&bih=1165&sxsrf=AKL5yDiXyRe5wvDIs
 jK_rt8R1lhI86OkIg:1794867787358&q=the+carolina+theatre+address&ludocid=172
 54318400457869379&ved=2ahUKEwisgYnHw42YAxWnHNAFHWSmFCEQ6BN6BAhEEAI): 309 W
  Morgan St\, Durham\, NC 27701\nPhone: [(919) 560-3030](https://www.google
 .com/search?sca_esv=9e40641db8ba5a4c&rlz=1C5AJCO_enUS1192US1199&sxsrf=AKL5
 yDj6cmnWTdvE2pa_Ee82-f2gUVzILQ:1794867706404&q=carolina+theater+durham+nc&
 source=lnms&fbs=ACAhTvyTnYaW3LjAmOOyZFuBy6inveUcQMa2xOl0TG1XZwD2OuT3ha3yUK
 HCmf35TOAeI3pqkSTRKhQmihnN0oszr8YJ2OTpfXUGcoBB2NuwPsIxul7QL5xg3DaQY87iiaLW
 NF58jaMLROWjUVA5oGTkCc-xPXSAPYjCS5RBNki0c6dEHSFR1QF6cGVymIMyZlypc1ERSD2s-z
 H1OKdG4CVZVrJBn99ShKLuqhCYhBsD1NS7UVFIbfE&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwi29rugw42YAxWx38
 kDHQlnAdAQ0pQJegQIEBAB&biw=2202&bih=1165&dpr=1#)\n**[Website](https://caro
 linatheatre.org/)**[ ](https://carolinatheatre.org/)\n\n**Partnership**\nW
 e'll be co-hosting this event along with Mark Hinkle and [the All Things A
 I Live meetup](https://www.meetup.com/all-things-ai-live/).\n\n**RSVP requ
 ired**\n\\*This is a free event. However\, an RSVP is required. Seating is
  limited\, so RSVP's will be capped as we fill up. Please move quickly and
  RSVP to save your spot if interested. When you RSVP you will be added to 
 our mailing list to receive future event updates. You can unsubscribe at a
 ny time.\n\n**Questions?** Contact us at [info@allthingsopen.org.](http://
 info@allthingsopen.org./)
