BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Triangleland": "https://triangleland.org/event/trail-talks-with-tlc-brumley-south"}
X-SOURCE-ID:triangleland
X-SOURCE:Triangle Land Conservancy
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261218T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261218T103000
DTSTAMP:20261116T175146Z
CREATED:20261116T171109Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261116T175146Z
UID:10000135-1797584400-1797589800@triangleland.org
SUMMARY:Trail Talks with TLC: Brumley South
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC Executive Director\, Sandy Sweitzer\, for a walk at her favorite part of Brumley Nature Preserve.\nIf you are a hiker or birder who has avoided Brumley South because of the mountain bikers\, join us! You’ll discover dedicated walking trails with cool rock formations\, beautiful hardwood forests\, and just enough hills to make it fun – all without worrying about a biker whizzing past. Sandy will share the history of the preserve\, this expansion\, and plans for possible future expansions. She’ll also share some highlights of the grand opening almost 10 years ago and how it has transformed TLC’s work. This event is free\, but preregistration is required.\n\n \n\n\n\nQuick Details:\n\n 	Hike Leader: Sandy Sweitzer\, TLC Executive Director\n 	Preserve Name & Planned Trails: Brumley Nature Preserve\, University Station Road entrance\n 	Distance & Speed: 90 minutes\, slow to moderate\n 	Age Group: 12 and older\n 	Dogs: Narrow trails may not be best for furry friends\n\n\n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please fill out the waitlist form here by December 16th at noon.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/trail-talks-with-tlc-brumley-south
LOCATION:Brumley South- University Station Entrance\, 3501 University Station Rd\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_f511c08827b961733168ea93761e472cd12de35e813c3a73af3e44c56b7fe53d
SUMMARY:UU Justice NC’s Friday Action Hour
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261218T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261218T120000
DTSTAMP:20261121T065002Z
UID:1tvd180uho6fnokuhaj2c5h1k8_R20251107T160000@google.com__20261218
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250729T151905Z
DESCRIPTION:11:00am-12:00pm: Unitarian Universalist Justice NC’s Friday 
 Action Hour. <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/w/87452791684?_x_zm_rtaid=7M
 gmJB_hSsCKh3xUYHZrBA.1750590489156.1865f9b53934845e34cb2d06c2d1adc5&_x_zm_
 rhtaid=5#success" target="_blank"><u>Zoom here </u></a><br><u> </u><br><
 p>Since May of 2020\, North Carolina UUs and friends have gathered on Frid
 ays to take action and experience the joy and power of community. Every Fr
 iday at 11:00am we recap the past week and take action on the issues impac
 ting our state and country. And there is always great music to help us fee
 l the justice movement in our bones! ALL are welcome! We are also blessed 
 to be joined by Unitarian Universalists\, our beloved North Carolina justi
 ce partners\, and dear friends from outside our state (shout out to our We
 st Virginia fam!).</p><p>You can join us <strong>every Friday </strong>at 
 11:00 am via this <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZMpcu
 uvpzosEtAhdqFHrSySSb6REM8wkPru">Zoom link</a>. And if you can't make it on
  Fridays\, you can still take action at any time - just check out our <a h
 ref="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Fwj6m0Qw4fAH_keuIoUNgdSWslBZzVgQ5
 NCgVPm_L-U/edit?tab=t.0" class="pastedDriveLink-0">Weekly action list</a>.
  And sign up for our <a href="https://secure.everyaction.com/QSBiJQ1YQEGwP
 O2KMIRIkQ2" target="_blank">Weekly Friday Action Hour Email</a> that inclu
 des a promo of the week's actions\, Zoom link\, and link to our Actions Go
 ogle Doc.</p><p><a href="https://www.uujusticenc.org/get-involved/friday-a
 ction-hour/">https://www.uujusticenc.org/get-involved/friday-action-hour/<
 /a> </p><u> </u>
