DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holiday season with festive storybooks read aroun
 d the historic hearth fire! This free program is full of Christmas cheer\,
  and will include three readings of winter and holiday-themed picture book
 s for young learners and seasonal fun for the whole family. Drop in anytim
 e\, but our readings will take place in the Vance house kitchen at 9:30\, 
 10:30\, and 11:30 am. Plus\, enjoy free face-painting\, candle-dipping\, a
 nd hot cider in the Visitor Center until noon!\n\nThis event is free and d
 oes not require registration in advance. If you have any questions\, pleas
 e reach out to us at vance@dncr.nc.gov or give us a call at (828) 645-6706
 !
