BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Defend Democracy Saturdays: Downtown Durham
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270130T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270130T113000
DTSTAMP:20261121T065001Z
UID:7vihpmeg1k6esqp5s5vsvq9hfe_R20260110T150000@google.com__20270130
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20251010T141601Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Saturday 
 from 10am-11:30am with signs to protect our democracy and protest the viol
 ations to our Constitution. We will meet at the YMCA at 218 West Morgan St
 .</p><p>We need to fight for our democracy and stop and prevent future cut
 s that are hurting many. Bring friends! Bring signs that show your concern
  or are a call to action. Please avoid triggering images like swastikas.</
 p><p>See you every Saturday morning engaging drivers &amp\; pedestrians in
  Downtown Durham!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="h
 ttps://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy">https
 ://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a></p><p>
 For more ED4D Mobilize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://www.mobilize
 .us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersf
 ordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfor
 democracy/event/842514/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocra
 cy/event/842514/</a> </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260108T021307Z
LOCATION:218 W Morgan St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_enoriver_org_9u7o786v1jlk6heq5cp3k1gr1k
SUMMARY:ERA - Let's Go Hike! - Occoneechee Mountain
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270130T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270130T120000
DTSTAMP:20261121T065004Z
UID:4lscvdvpe2m36mpoir90i0rjjg@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20270130T100000
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20261120T150929Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Registration is <b>not </b>required for <u>Let's Go Hike hi
 kes</u>\, so come on out and join us at 10am for this 3 mile hike. These h
 ikes are a great opportunity to meet new hiking friends\, explore the Eno\
 , and learn a bit about this beautiful river.</p><p>This hike will take ap
 proximately two hours (sometimes less\, sometimes more). Please feel free 
 to bring water and snacks. Wear comfortable\, weather-appropriate clothing
  and shoes. Well-behaved dogs are welcome as long as they are under your c
 ontrol and on a 6 foot leash.<br></p><p>Meet your hike leader next to the 
 parking area at Occoneechee Mountain State Natural Area at 10am to begin t
 he hike.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261120T151029Z
LOCATION:Occoneechee Mountain State Natural Area\, 625 Virginia Cates Rd\,
  Hillsborough\, NC 27278\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:Eno River Association
END:VEVENT
