DESCRIPTION:Discover why wetlands matter at Haw River State Park's first ev
 er Wetlands Celebration! Designed for visitors of all ages and part of the
  NC Science Festival\, this free event will feature guided hikes\, demonst
 rations\, games\, interactive displays\, and more offered by park educator
 s and local organizations related to environmental conservation.\n\nThe We
 tlands Celebration is a perfect chance to connect with neighbors\, learn m
 ore about our state's wonderful wetlands\, and enjoy the beauty of the par
 k. We hope to see you there!
GEO:36.23742;-79.785591
LOCATION:Haw River State Park - Iron Ore Belt Access 
SUMMARY:Wetlands Celebration
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/wetlands-celebration
